{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bx9YfnZ7Jh1792042147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港股造好，指數一度升逾500點。</p><p></p><p>恒指高開268點後，升幅逐步擴大，指數曾升逾500點，升穿22,500點水平。</p><p></p><p>理想汽車季績後，股價升逾一成。科網股有份支撐大市，阿里巴巴及美團升百分之3至4。資源股有追捧，紫金礦業及洛陽鉬業升百分之4至5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:01:00.141726+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:14:27.490531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:54:20.183161+00:00","content_hash":"f25ce0f73ef47cdd31752412d5cf6cd94e6ec78ce2478706a5fc9a0742eaa3f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:01:00.141726+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}